        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RTS where you are tasked to investigate sightings of mysterious creatures and battle against hostile forces! Based on the classic Command &amp; Conquer series, the game will feel very familiar, but plays a lot different than your average strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanics are very simple! You can build units and buildings and you can give them orders. Your job is to keep them alive as long as possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't expect to stay in the game for too long, you have to be quick and manage your troops to avoid losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natively supports the SteamDeck! Other controllers are not fully supported yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect your base at all costs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy players will constantly try to control the map and remove you from it. Be vigilant and never leave your base undefended!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch out for the supernatural!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the first responder to handle supernatural events, so don't be surprised when something new appears and be wary, they are usually out to get you!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find artifacts to help you survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artifacts are collectibles that will give you passive effects. They are the key to your survival in the long run!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small indie RTS game, and our first released project. I hope it gives you a couple hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Art made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aleksandr Makarov: iknowkingrabbit.itch.io, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Csizmadia Bálint: majom48.itch.io,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>my sister</i><br><br><br><br><i>Music made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>alkakrab: alkakrab.itch.io</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RTS where you are tasked to investigate sightings of mysterious creatures and battle against hostile forces! Based on the classic Command &amp; Conquer series, the game will feel very familiar, but plays a lot different than your average strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanics are very simple! You can build units and buildings and you can give them orders. Your job is to keep them alive as long as possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't expect to stay in the game for too long, you have to be quick and manage your troops to avoid losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natively supports the SteamDeck! Other controllers are not fully supported yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect your base at all costs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/765e18acba79c4dd4f6a2bd3afbe7cd2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy players will constantly try to control the map and remove you from it. Be vigilant and never leave your base undefended!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch out for the supernatural!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/06673a892fbb6e9386987f25edffc7cd.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the first responder to handle supernatural events, so don't be surprised when something new appears and be wary, they are usually out to get you!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find artifacts to help you survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.poster.avif?t=1764877212\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.webm?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967040/extras/34cc0fe30af556f21c2ab99f54c18be2.mp4?t=1764877212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artifacts are collectibles that will give you passive effects. They are the key to your survival in the long run!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small indie RTS game, and our first released project. I hope it gives you a couple hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Art made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aleksandr Makarov: iknowkingrabbit.itch.io, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Csizmadia Bálint: majom48.itch.io,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>my sister</i><br><br><br><br><i>Music made by: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>alkakrab: alkakrab.itch.io</i></p>",
